# drop-LESS conversion: the reference build. IGNORED AGAIN SINCE P8 — this is the retirement
# of S47, which the execution plan scheduled here.
#
# It was tracked between 2026-08-10 and P8, deliberately and temporarily. The reason was S45:
# every 4th-layer verification round has to prove it did not touch `baseline/`, and the proof it
# was told to use is `git status --porcelain` — which, while the directory was ignored, could not
# go red no matter what happened to the reference build. Tracking made any write loud.
#
# WHY IT IS SAFE TO IGNORE AGAIN: with the conversion finished there are no more verification
# rounds to keep honest, and the byte-level pin never depended on git in the first place —
# `doc/baseline-manifest.sha256` (86 sha256 lines, checked by `npm run check:baseline`, and
# verifiable without this repo's scripts via `shasum -a 256 -c`) is what actually pins it.
# `npm run baseline` rebuilds it with `npx --yes zkless-engine@1.1.13`, so a rebuild does not
# need the dependency P8 removed.
baseline/